.Sh HISTORY
The
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_set0_crls
function was added in OpenSSL 1.0.0. The
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_get_num_untrusted
function was added in OpenSSL 1.1.0. The
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_new_ex
function was added in OpenSSL 3.0. The
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_init_rpk ,
.Xr X509_STORE_CTX_get0_rpk 3 ,
and
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_set0_rpk
functions were added in OpenSSL 3.2.
.Pp
There is no need to call
.Fn X509_STORE_CTX_cleanup
explicitly since OpenSSL 3.0.
